MAIN
MOVE TEMP 9 4
MOVE TEMP 10 HALLOCATE TEMP 9
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 10
MOVE TEMP 11 4
MOVE TEMP 12 HALLOCATE TEMP 11
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 12
MOVE TEMP 13 A_check
HSTORE TEMP 6 0 TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 14 TEMP 6
HSTORE TEMP 5 0 TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 5
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 7 0
MOVE TEMP 15 CALL TEMP 8 ( TEMP 4 )
PRINT TEMP 15
END
A_check [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 16 10
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 17 20
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 17
MOVE TEMP 18 30
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 19 LE TEMP 1 TEMP 3
CJUMP TEMP 19 L0
MOVE TEMP 20 PLUS TEMP 2 TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 20
L0  NOOP

RETURN TEMP 1
END

